// the spec ebreak encoding (0x00100073, emitted by gcc) must stop like ebreak:
// r2 must not be written
// XFAIL: the simulator decodes the spec ebreak as an ecall (a7 = 5 -> ignored, execution continues)
// EXPECT r2 = 0
// CONFIGS: ideal
[0] 00000000   00500893   addi r17, r0, 5
[1] 0x000004   00100073   ebreak
[2] 0x000008   00200113   addi r2, r0, 2
[3] 0x00000c   00000893   addi r17, r0, 0
[4] 0x000010   00000073   ecall
